WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.535
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.502
We're so happy to have you all

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:04.304
with us tonight

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.638
and, now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.374
President Biden spoke
from the White House yesterday

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.542
about the economy
and rising prices

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:13.580
and you could kind of tell
things aren't going great.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.949
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.651
Top Democrats have reportedly
been pushing the White House

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.421
to have President Biden speak
to the press more often.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:23.456
And so are top Republicans.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.358
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.994
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki said on Monday

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:31.697
that President Biden intends
to run for reelection in 2024.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:36.169
Okay, if the next election is
between this guy...

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:37.670
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.372
...and this guy...

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.207
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:44.577
...we have to stop calling it
"running" for president.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.245
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:48.615
Call it like
carefully shuffling.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.784
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.685
Former President Obama
was nominated

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.088
for a Grammy yesterday,
and this is crazy --

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.623
it was
for Best Latin Jazz Album.

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.092
[ Laughter ]
-Whoo!

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:02.529
-Is there anything
that guy can't do?

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.430
Republican Congressman
Jim Jordan revealed,

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.899
in a new interview, that he had
the coronavirus over the summer

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:09.335
and refused to say whether he's
received the vaccine.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:12.338
Well, "refused to say"
is pretty big clue.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.074
[ Laughter ]
Nobody refuses to say

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:16.376
when they do the right thing.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.244
"Did you pull all those children

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.812
out of that burning
building, sir?"

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:21.147
[ As Jordan ]
I'd rather not say.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.849
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:25.518
Rescuing children
is a personal decision.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.220
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.322
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassley

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:31.924
tweeted out a picture yesterday
of his vacuum cleaner.

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:33.392
He didn't mean to.

00:01:33.392 --> 00:01:35.228
He was just trying
to call his daughter.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:40.699
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.699 --> 00:01:43.536
According to the latest numbers,
the average cost

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:46.772
for a ten-person Thanksgiving
dinner is $53,

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.274
not including bail money.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.977
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:52.511
Finally,
The Hershey Company offered

00:01:52.511 --> 00:01:54.046
a giant, nine-inch, three-pound

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:55.715
Reese's Peanut Butter Cup
this year

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:57.950
that is meant to serve
as a pie on Thanksgiving.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.386
Perfect for anyone
that wants to show their family

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.921
they cared enough to stop
at a 7-Eleven on the way.

00:02:02.921 --> 00:02:05.058
[ Laughter ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

